## 6.1 Build a rigorous anatomy coverage matrix

For all twelve systems, track:

- Anatomical concept coverage.
- Real 3D mesh coverage.
- Individual structure coverage.
- Regional coverage.
- Left/right coverage.
- Important substructures.
- Anatomical relationships.
- Educational content.
- Practical identification coverage.
